      <title>10年期美债收益率突破特朗普2.0高位 油价同步逼近90美元</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260831/10%E5%B9%B4%E6%9C%9F%E7%BE%8E%E5%80%BA%E6%94%B6%E7%9B%8A%E7%8E%87%E7%AA%81%E7%A0%B4%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE2.0%E9%AB%98%E4%BD%8D-%E6%B2%B9%E4%BB%B7%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5%E9%80%BC%E8%BF%9190%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83/</link>
